WEBVTT

00:00:15.065 --> 00:00:21.005
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:21.005 --> 00:00:26.745
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.745 --> 00:00:32.555
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.555 --> 00:00:37.455
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.455 --> 00:00:43.295
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.295 --> 00:00:49.975
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:49.975 --> 00:00:55.705
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.705 --> 00:01:00.885
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:00.885 --> 00:01:06.655
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.655 --> 00:01:13.165
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.165 --> 00:01:18.835
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:18.835 --> 00:01:23.975
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:23.975 --> 00:01:27.775
Shine the light!

00:01:31.161 --> 00:01:33.191
Seven Stars! I'll destroy you!

00:01:48.381 --> 00:01:51.181
Even so, I will...

00:01:51.181 --> 00:01:53.311
live as a human!

00:01:59.821 --> 00:02:01.691
Mo... m...

00:02:07.361 --> 00:02:11.731
Don't try to die without my permission...

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:12.721
since...

00:02:14.201 --> 00:02:16.401
I need you.

00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:18.511
Okay.

00:02:20.941 --> 00:02:22.041
Ouri!

00:02:22.881 --> 00:02:24.371
Ah!

00:02:27.051 --> 00:02:28.611
It's gonna crash!

00:02:36.861 --> 00:02:37.691
"Lkai City"

00:03:02.821 --> 00:03:03.791
"MNN News Flash"

00:03:03.791 --> 00:03:06.721
"Airplanes Crashed in Inner-City
Number of Victims May be Large"

00:03:07.721 --> 00:03:09.491
There has been some late-breaking news.

00:03:09.491 --> 00:03:13.001
A Self-Defense Force jet and
a commercial flight have crashed.

00:03:13.001 --> 00:03:14.661
There seem to be many victims.

00:03:16.001 --> 00:03:18.571
We received news about a plane crash.

00:03:18.571 --> 00:03:21.131
We'll let you know more as
soon as we know the details.

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:22.341
"Multiple Airplanes Crashed in Inner-City"

00:03:22.341 --> 00:03:23.811
"Multiple Airplanes Crashed in Inner-City"
In the area nearby lkai Station,

00:03:23.811 --> 00:03:25.441
"Multiple Airplanes Crashed in Inner-City"
a land sinkage of unknown
cause has occurred

00:03:25.441 --> 00:03:25.511
"Multiple Airplanes Crashed in Inner-City"
and has caused damage
including leaning buildings.

00:03:25.511 --> 00:03:28.281
And has caused damage
including leaning buildings.

00:03:28.281 --> 00:03:32.681
In some areas, due to natural gas
emissions, access has been restricted.

00:03:33.421 --> 00:03:38.021
So this is the Seven Stars' plan...
What kind of curse...

00:03:38.021 --> 00:03:39.761
So where are the Seven Stars?

00:03:39.761 --> 00:03:44.031
They disappeared.
We don't know where they went.

00:03:44.031 --> 00:03:47.201
I was the one who ordered them to
retreat after hearing about the damage.

00:03:47.201 --> 00:03:49.871
We don't have time to argue.

00:03:49.871 --> 00:03:55.101
Since the incident with Senior Tagami,
they've directly pursued their goal.

00:03:55.771 --> 00:04:01.481
We just considered it a
challenge to the Kougon Sect.

00:04:01.481 --> 00:04:03.281
There's no way we could have known.

00:04:03.281 --> 00:04:07.941
While targeting contracted monks, they tried
to invade the area around the head temple.

00:04:08.321 --> 00:04:11.321
And Shikabane were persistently produced...

00:04:11.321 --> 00:04:15.791
How could we have known that it was
all done to spread defilement in lkai City?

00:04:15.791 --> 00:04:19.331
Those defiled ones and the
enormous amount of deaths with regrets...

00:04:19.331 --> 00:04:23.701
That means there have probably been in
the range of thousands to tens of thousands

00:04:23.701 --> 00:04:26.841
of Shikabane suddenly
produced in lkai City.

00:04:26.841 --> 00:04:31.531
Then this is like "there's no one who
doesn't become a Shikabane when they die."

00:04:33.681 --> 00:04:36.981
Huh? Don't you think it's funny?

00:04:36.981 --> 00:04:39.821
It's part of the narration
of a famous samurai drama!

00:04:39.821 --> 00:04:43.021
Geez... Don't explain your
joke each time. It's embarrassing.

00:04:43.021 --> 00:04:45.651
No one even has the energy to laugh.

00:04:45.651 --> 00:04:47.091
Why?

00:04:47.091 --> 00:04:51.231
We exist in order to kill 108 Shikabane.

00:04:51.231 --> 00:04:56.861
If there're swarms of Shikabane,
today is our "Go to Heaven Day"!

00:05:00.941 --> 00:05:04.101
It's a convenient day to die, huh?

00:05:07.381 --> 00:05:11.381
We can't leave lkai City like this.

00:05:11.381 --> 00:05:15.381
Even if each Shikabane Hime kills
108 Shikabane, it may not be enough.

00:05:15.381 --> 00:05:19.291
Are you worried about
Shikabane Hime dying?

00:05:19.291 --> 00:05:22.881
Rather, that's their wish.

00:05:27.061 --> 00:05:30.261
Wipe out the Shikabane in lkai City!

00:05:34.271 --> 00:05:38.211
Your Grace, that would
make the defense here weak.

00:05:38.211 --> 00:05:45.111
We, the Kougon Sect, exist to return
Shikabane to the philosophy of laws.

00:05:48.821 --> 00:05:51.721
How many Shikabane Hime are available?

00:05:51.721 --> 00:05:53.621
Eleven.

00:05:53.621 --> 00:05:55.821
They, as well as their
contracted monks, are going.

00:05:55.821 --> 00:05:59.601
Those who need to replenish their
ritual articles and weapons, hurry up!

00:05:59.601 --> 00:06:01.001
Where are we going?

00:06:01.001 --> 00:06:02.431
The cauldron of Hell.

00:06:02.431 --> 00:06:06.671
Wow! So exciting! I feel a thrill!

00:06:06.671 --> 00:06:08.771
Anything from Makina Hoshimura?

00:06:08.771 --> 00:06:12.671
We haven't known her whereabouts
since we got separated underground.

00:06:12.671 --> 00:06:14.781
Ouri hasn't contacted us, either.

00:06:14.781 --> 00:06:17.681
But I don't think there's any need to worry.

00:06:18.411 --> 00:06:20.781
I bet they've destroyed one
of the Seven Stars together

00:06:20.781 --> 00:06:22.841
and now should be heading here.

00:06:24.191 --> 00:06:25.481
Yeah.

00:06:27.691 --> 00:06:29.781
I'm going by myself.

00:06:30.431 --> 00:06:32.801
That probably isn't enough this time.

00:06:32.801 --> 00:06:35.661
But if anything goes wrong...

00:06:36.501 --> 00:06:39.501
Akasha's target isn't the head temple.

00:06:39.501 --> 00:06:47.101
But we're never to say that in front of
anyone, including His Grace Dai-Sojo.

00:06:50.781 --> 00:06:52.611
Is that it?

00:06:52.851 --> 00:06:57.451
What can I do? Since Umehara
and the others took most of them,

00:06:57.451 --> 00:07:00.461
it wasn't easy to gather even these.

00:07:00.461 --> 00:07:05.291
Do as you please.
But hurry up. Akasha is coming.

00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:11.891
Don't forget... that your
goal isn't just killing Akasha.

00:07:12.471 --> 00:07:15.201
We won't let anyone
get close to that place.

00:07:15.201 --> 00:07:18.211
Even contracted monks or Shikabane Hime.

00:07:18.211 --> 00:07:20.201
I'm counting on you.

00:07:28.381 --> 00:07:30.011
They got in!

00:07:44.571 --> 00:07:46.401
Everyone! Are you okay?!

00:07:46.401 --> 00:07:47.441
Ouri!

00:07:47.441 --> 00:07:50.701
What?! Hanagami!
Don't scare us like that!

00:08:03.891 --> 00:08:05.221
Ouri...

00:08:06.361 --> 00:08:08.411
Please go.

00:08:10.731 --> 00:08:11.691
Ouri!

00:08:11.691 --> 00:08:15.891
We're going on ahead, so you
hurry up and come, too, okay? Hanagami!

00:08:28.041 --> 00:08:31.051
Ouri was like Keisei, wasn't he...

00:08:31.051 --> 00:08:33.211
Yeah.

00:08:36.491 --> 00:08:41.821
Why aren't you going with them?
They may run into Shikabane on their way.

00:08:41.821 --> 00:08:44.631
You can feel it, right? The Seven Stars...

00:08:44.631 --> 00:08:49.061
Hokuto is heading in a
different direction than lkai City.

00:08:49.061 --> 00:08:52.171
The place where I was once locked up.

00:08:52.171 --> 00:08:55.161
The mountain where the
purification chamber is...

00:08:55.741 --> 00:08:57.071
Let's hurry.

00:08:57.071 --> 00:09:00.181
But there're Shikabane in town.

00:09:00.181 --> 00:09:02.241
No...

00:09:02.241 --> 00:09:04.781
This isn't just your revenge.

00:09:04.781 --> 00:09:07.681
I also want revenge on the Seven Stars...

00:09:07.681 --> 00:09:13.681
for the deaths of Brother,
my friends and my brothers.

00:09:25.271 --> 00:09:26.671
Your Grace...

00:09:26.671 --> 00:09:31.541
The purification chamber exorcises
a Shikabane Hime's defilement.

00:09:31.541 --> 00:09:36.681
Hence, it is also the most defiled
place among the Kougon Sect's lands.

00:09:36.681 --> 00:09:40.051
And there's another thing here...

00:10:25.861 --> 00:10:27.531
- What a bad joke, combining the Seven Stars'
power and a zadan technique, Akasha...

00:10:27.531 --> 00:10:31.831
- Bug... It's a bug! Bug!
- What a bad joke, combining the Seven Stars'
power and a zadan technique, Akasha...

00:10:31.831 --> 00:10:34.231
It's you, Senior Mibu, isn't it...

00:10:34.341 --> 00:10:36.001
Let's make a big show.

00:10:36.001 --> 00:10:37.611
Okay!

00:10:37.611 --> 00:10:39.441
How impertinent!

00:10:41.181 --> 00:10:44.911
If you think I'm still the same
as before, that's a big mistake!

00:11:00.061 --> 00:11:04.371
Senior Mibu... no, Sadahiro-san.

00:11:04.371 --> 00:11:09.541
You're not my enemy. The Kougon Sect is.

00:11:09.541 --> 00:11:11.911
You too must've seen...

00:11:11.911 --> 00:11:14.781
what happened to my Shikabane Hime,

00:11:14.781 --> 00:11:18.281
Hibiki Shijou, on that day.

00:11:18.281 --> 00:11:20.981
That was a trap.

00:11:20.981 --> 00:11:26.051
It wasn't just a few Shikabane,
but over 100 Shikabane.

00:11:26.891 --> 00:11:29.881
My Shikabane Hime was strong.

00:11:34.631 --> 00:11:37.831
So even while she was
being eaten by Hazama's bugs,

00:11:37.831 --> 00:11:41.941
she kept fighting
and fighting and fighting...

00:11:41.941 --> 00:11:45.631
until she killed over 108 Shikabane.

00:11:47.341 --> 00:11:48.411
And...

00:11:48.411 --> 00:11:50.651
Don't say any more!

00:11:50.651 --> 00:11:54.481
You know it!
So does your Shikabane Hime!

00:11:54.481 --> 00:11:59.291
That's why we can kill not only
Shikabane but humans as well!

00:11:59.291 --> 00:12:03.451
Since I saw the darkness once,
I had no choice but to take this path.

00:12:04.291 --> 00:12:05.961
But Akasha!

00:12:05.961 --> 00:12:09.121
We're not like you!

00:12:14.371 --> 00:12:18.501
It's your zadan against mine!

00:12:24.611 --> 00:12:25.851
Hokuto-sama.

00:12:25.851 --> 00:12:26.841
Hm?

00:12:27.651 --> 00:12:30.391
Are you producing the water again?

00:12:30.391 --> 00:12:34.491
The origin of the Kougon Sect
is ahead of here.

00:12:34.491 --> 00:12:40.221
Then I'm going there. I'm their enemy.

00:12:42.161 --> 00:12:42.701
Ah!

00:12:42.701 --> 00:12:44.231
Wait!

00:12:44.231 --> 00:12:46.561
They're going inside.

00:12:48.201 --> 00:12:50.401
Sadahiro-san! Akira-san!

00:12:50.541 --> 00:12:52.011
"Lkai Station"

00:13:10.691 --> 00:13:12.261
What's the matter?

00:13:12.261 --> 00:13:15.761
It's just... even though
it could be a survivor,

00:13:15.761 --> 00:13:19.071
I shoot as soon as I see something move.

00:13:19.071 --> 00:13:20.741
I'm doing the same.

00:13:20.741 --> 00:13:22.601
Zero survivors!

00:13:22.601 --> 00:13:25.661
It'll be announced that
way in the morning anyway!

00:13:27.941 --> 00:13:31.211
Whoa! So big!
We're in trouble because it's too big!

00:13:31.211 --> 00:13:33.511
You seem to be relaxed.

00:13:42.791 --> 00:13:48.131
Splendid! Just as you'd expect from
the Shikabane Hime called the strongest.

00:13:49.061 --> 00:13:53.801
Seven Stars! No matter how
much you scatter about defilement,

00:13:53.801 --> 00:13:57.211
following our philosophy,
we will protect the human world!

00:13:57.211 --> 00:13:59.541
If we stir you guys up,

00:13:59.541 --> 00:14:02.811
Shikabane Hime will gather on the
pretext of "Subduing the Seven Stars."

00:14:02.811 --> 00:14:06.711
However, you guys
can no longer leave here.

00:14:08.121 --> 00:14:10.551
Are they that reserve unit?

00:14:10.751 --> 00:14:15.391
We heard that you were kidnapped,
but you seem to be okay. Good.

00:14:15.391 --> 00:14:17.161
Get out of my way.

00:14:17.161 --> 00:14:22.001
We won't let you go beyond this point.
Humans or Shikabane Hime.

00:14:22.001 --> 00:14:26.671
What're you saying? That was Akasha, right?
I also saw the Seven Stars.

00:14:26.671 --> 00:14:28.441
Let's follow them!

00:14:28.441 --> 00:14:32.071
We will, after we stop you two.

00:14:32.071 --> 00:14:35.111
Why? Why are you stopping us?

00:14:35.111 --> 00:14:40.021
Because that's the order.
We won't let anyone go beyond here.

00:14:40.021 --> 00:14:44.351
The purification chamber is
ahead of here, right? What's in there?

00:14:44.351 --> 00:14:46.121
Are you stupid?

00:14:46.121 --> 00:14:49.851
If we could tell you, we wouldn't
have to go through all this trouble!

00:14:57.271 --> 00:14:58.671
Stop it, Makina!

00:14:58.671 --> 00:15:01.601
Akira-san is a Shikabane Hime,
just like you are, right?!

00:15:01.601 --> 00:15:04.001
She's just an enemy.

00:15:08.181 --> 00:15:10.011
This is a zadan technique.

00:15:10.011 --> 00:15:13.781
You know, right?
If you take it, there'll be consequences.

00:15:13.781 --> 00:15:16.891
Haven't you gone far enough?
Go back, Ouri!

00:15:16.891 --> 00:15:19.991
Sadahiro Mibu-san, was it?

00:15:19.991 --> 00:15:23.861
Why? What's ahead of here?

00:15:26.031 --> 00:15:31.001
Listen carefully, Ouri.
We've killed not only Shikabane

00:15:31.001 --> 00:15:35.571
but also those humans who tried to
make the Shikabane's existence public

00:15:35.571 --> 00:15:40.711
after they came to know it,
or those who hide Shikabane.

00:15:40.711 --> 00:15:45.181
And it wasn't just one or two people.
Dozens of people!

00:15:45.181 --> 00:15:46.171
What?

00:15:46.581 --> 00:15:48.811
It wasn't always that way.

00:15:49.321 --> 00:15:53.691
But from one point, we chose this path.

00:15:53.691 --> 00:15:57.851
We felt that if we didn't,
we would go crazy.

00:15:58.691 --> 00:16:02.831
So the secret lying ahead
of here is that big, huh?

00:16:02.831 --> 00:16:05.771
You guys don't have to know anything.

00:16:05.771 --> 00:16:07.841
Don't talk like you know everything!

00:16:07.841 --> 00:16:08.701
What?

00:16:09.541 --> 00:16:13.241
Don't act like you two were
the only ones who saw hell.

00:16:13.241 --> 00:16:16.281
I've been seeing hell myself all this time.

00:16:16.281 --> 00:16:21.341
Even so, I haven't lost hope!
You're in my way!

00:16:25.551 --> 00:16:27.381
We're gonna shoot!

00:16:40.541 --> 00:16:44.571
Was that... your zadan, Ouri?!

00:16:44.571 --> 00:16:47.201
I will... protect Makina!

00:16:49.781 --> 00:16:54.881
Hey, a Shikabane Hime is a shield that
exists to protect her contracted monk!

00:16:54.881 --> 00:16:57.721
What's the point in protecting her?!

00:17:10.671 --> 00:17:14.441
Brother saved my life,

00:17:14.441 --> 00:17:18.241
but I killed him.

00:17:18.241 --> 00:17:21.641
I couldn't return any of my debt to him.

00:17:21.641 --> 00:17:29.241
So... So! This time, I'll protect Makina
who Brother risked his life to protect.

00:17:35.791 --> 00:17:38.021
Ah! Sadahiro!

00:17:40.531 --> 00:17:44.161
I'm going through here! I'm sorry!

00:17:47.641 --> 00:17:49.541
Ow, ow, ow!

00:17:49.541 --> 00:17:52.341
You could've dodged that, right?

00:17:55.381 --> 00:18:00.781
Keisei... it was a good
thing that you took him in.

00:18:18.201 --> 00:18:19.871
So you are here.

00:18:19.871 --> 00:18:22.871
The Kougon Sect will be finished today.

00:18:22.871 --> 00:18:26.241
All the dead will have their freedom back.

00:18:26.241 --> 00:18:28.641
Watch your mouth, traitor monk!

00:18:36.321 --> 00:18:39.391
Is this your zadan, Gon-Dai-Sojo?

00:18:39.391 --> 00:18:41.361
This is a technique that
is known only among us.

00:18:41.361 --> 00:18:45.391
It purifies the area and
eliminates all defilement.

00:18:45.391 --> 00:18:51.071
Any zadan techniques by others or
Shikabane become powerless in this space.

00:18:51.071 --> 00:18:53.741
Step back, traitor monk!

00:18:53.741 --> 00:18:56.241
Am I your enemy?

00:18:56.241 --> 00:19:02.611
Stay back! A Shikabane would
turn into dust in this space!

00:19:02.611 --> 00:19:05.701
So I am your enemy...

00:19:07.021 --> 00:19:08.041
Hokuto!

00:19:18.691 --> 00:19:21.031
She doesn't disappear?!

00:19:42.481 --> 00:19:44.721
Scripture on Shikabane Hime Laws?

00:19:44.721 --> 00:19:46.721
That's right.

00:19:46.721 --> 00:19:51.091
The last volume of the
Scripture on Shikabane Hime Laws,

00:19:51.091 --> 00:19:54.161
the most important and most holy
one among the Kougon Sect scriptures.

00:19:54.161 --> 00:19:57.621
It's the one stolen from the
Hoshimura Family at one time.

00:19:59.001 --> 00:20:02.441
Are you saying that
you put that on her body?

00:20:02.441 --> 00:20:06.981
That's right. The purest shield.

00:20:06.981 --> 00:20:10.351
So you can no longer harm Hokuto.

00:20:10.351 --> 00:20:14.681
Hokuto! Break the coffin in front of you!

00:21:05.401 --> 00:21:06.801
Ah!

00:21:06.801 --> 00:21:08.701
Makina!

00:21:10.871 --> 00:21:15.681
This is the same as the time Keisei died.

00:21:15.681 --> 00:21:18.511
Rika, where are you?

00:21:18.511 --> 00:21:21.051
Why?

00:21:21.051 --> 00:21:22.681
Takamasa...

00:21:22.681 --> 00:21:26.521
My power is... disappearing...

00:21:27.691 --> 00:21:30.561
This is... The bond!

00:21:30.561 --> 00:21:32.531
Can't be!

00:21:36.431 --> 00:21:38.561
Makina...

00:21:43.571 --> 00:21:49.571
The bond that tied you and me...
has disappeared...

00:21:55.081 --> 00:22:02.761
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:22:02.761 --> 00:22:06.791
I've just taken a big step forward

00:22:06.791 --> 00:22:14.471
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:22:14.471 --> 00:22:22.401
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:22:25.111 --> 00:22:30.921
"Is there a future where I'm headed?"

00:22:30.921 --> 00:22:36.821
I asked the gray sky above

00:22:36.821 --> 00:22:42.661
I can move forward only by fighting

00:22:42.661 --> 00:22:48.471
I live life ineptly, as it's the only way I know

00:22:48.471 --> 00:22:53.571
So I'm constantly struggling

00:22:53.571 --> 00:23:01.321
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:23:01.321 --> 00:23:05.351
I've just taken a big step forward

00:23:05.351 --> 00:23:13.031
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:23:13.031 --> 00:23:20.931
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:23:25.511 --> 00:23:29.811
"By killing 108 Shikabane,
you can go to heaven."

00:23:29.811 --> 00:23:34.351
The girls have been fighting
believing in that promise.

00:23:34.351 --> 00:23:40.011
However, "one hundred and eight lies"
are about to be revealed.
